<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan T$50 bln govt bond average yield 6.251 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan T$50 bln govt bond average yield 6.251 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said on Tuesday it auctioned T$50 billion in 10-year 86/4 government bonds with an average yield of 6.251 percent.  </p>
<p>The range of the yield was between 6.225 percent and 6.260 percent, a ministry official said.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$98.35 billion, the official said.</p>
<p>The central bank completed the auction on behalf of the finance ministry.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
